<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-PROFILE OF MEN'S 30 KM WORLD CHAMPION.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-PROFILE OF MEN'S 30 KM WORLD CHAMPION.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profile of the winner of Friday's 30 km freestyle cross-country race at the Nordic skiing world championships: Name: Alexei Prokurorov Country: Russia Age: 32 Previous world championship titles: none Other facts: Prokurorov won Olympic gold in the 30 km, classic style event in 1988 in Calgary. He has scored seven World Cup wins in his career but had not managed a top 10 placing this season.</p>
</text>
